window.products.push({"id":500022,"name":"24-Piece Kids Dinnerware Set Plastic 4 Plates, 4 Bowls, 4 Cups, 4 Forks, 4 Knives, and 4 Spoons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uMunl8K0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get your kids excited for dinner with these bright color coordinated Non-disposable playful Cups. Keeping kids in mind, These dinnerware were designed to perfectly suit small hands. Easy grip, break-resistant, and lightweight design makes it easy to hold and sturdy plastic makes it durable for continual use. What's more, the Cups, plates and bowls are stackable making them super compact for storage and the ideal Non-disposable alternative tableware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uMunl8K0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Basicwise","source_asin":"B07RMBZYZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RMBZYZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RMBZYZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":500023,"name":"DECORARTS- Silver Almond Blossom Tree, Vincent Van Gogh Art Reproduction, Giclee Print on 100% cotton Canvas for Home Decor and Wall Decor 24x30 x1.5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uGBd78sZL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Blossoming Almond Tree is one of Vincent van Gogh's best known paintings and is noteworthy in that both Van Gogh and his closest family held the work in high regard. Brand Quality: production from one of the world's leading wall decor manufacturers Made in USA: real handcrafted canvas prints produced and hand-stretched in California About Giclee Prints Giclee printing is meant to produce a product at a higher quality and longer lifespan than a standard desktop inkjet printer, the word was used to describe digital reproductions of conventional artworks (painting or drawing) or photographs. There are at least Three basic criteria, which must be met in order for the print to be considered a true giclee... 1. For giclee printing, the paper or substrate used to actually print the final piece must be acid free and consists of a 100% cotton base. 2. Any image that is to be printed as a giclee needs to be created at a resolution of no less than 300 dots per inch (DPI). This is to ensure that the final print has the sharpest detail and lacks any of the fragmentation that can occur with images less than 300 DPI. 3. The last step to creating or confirming a true giclee print is the type of ink and printer used. The biggest contrast between a standard inkjet print and a giclee print is that giclees are printed using pigment-based inks rather than the dye-based inks found in lower cost inkjets. Pigment-based inks have a longer life span that can last anywhere from 100 to 120 years without significant fading. The Quality : The quality of the giclee print rivals traditional silver-halide and gelatin printing processes and is commonly found in museums, art galleries, and photographic galleries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uGBd78sZL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECORARTS","source_asin":"B00UECBD5U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UECBD5U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UECBD5U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
