window.products.push({"id":500044,"name":"Cieovo 50 Pack Cheer Ribbon Fairy Wands Wedding Send Off Streamers with Bells Silk Fairy Stick Wand Party Favors for Wedding Party Activities Baby Sho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rUkuv0O9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"When you are going to hold Wedding / Birthday Party / Baby shower/ Bridal Shower! Create a magical wedding with these beautiful Wedding party ribbon fairy wands. There are bells at the top of the wands which make a light sound when you move them. Great to use when the bride is leaving the church or the wedding venue instead of confetti. Designing your own perfect wedding. You and your guests will adore these as they will add the missing touch of glamour to your wedding decor. Better than the other ribbons wands: Our new Champagne ribbon magic wand is made of better quality ribbons. Our bells are larger than normal bells, and the color of the bells is much brighter than the other bell. Especially with the cute gold bell, it jingles when waving it, adding a cheerful atmosphere in party or wedding. Adds a festive flair to the celebration and great photo opportunities at send off. Specifications : Material : premium quality ribbons, sticks, and bells. Size wooden stick : 30cm (11.8 inch) ribbon length : 60cm (23.6 inch) ribbon width : 1.5cm (0.6inch) Quantity :50pcs NOTE : 1 : Looks beautiful gathered into a vase as a centerpiece as well when don't use them. 2 : If the bell of the ribbon magic wand you received does not ring, Please pick up the ribbon fairy wands and gently tap it on the table. This is because when the bell of the wand is gold-plated, the ball in the bell may stick to the inner shell of the bell. So When you get a wand that doesn't ring, you need to gently knock down the table with a wand bell. This will make a noise. thank you for understanding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rUkuv0O9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CIEOVO","source_asin":"B07HNZ3RN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HNZ3RN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HNZ3RN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":500045,"name":"Kitchen Cooking Utensils Set 32pcs Silicone Cooking Utensils Set Kitchen Utensil Set with Holder Cooking Utensils for Nonstick Cookware Heat Resistant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pegz7DsnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍴 【COOK LIKE A CHEF AT HOME】 Make your life more refined. Professional kitchen cooking utensils set has everything you need to get started with your kitchen or replace your current cooking utensils set. You can use these cooking utensils to make curry, pasta sauces and soups etc. And the color of this silicone cooking utensils set is neutral so it goes with any kitchen. This kitchen utensil set is a great gift for anyone who loves to cook, a nice gift set for house warming party/ wedding party. 🍴 【FOOD GRADE SAFE SILICONE】 The silicone cooking utensils set can withstand high temperatures up to 446°F/230°C. Food-grade silicone, BPA Free, Lead Free, ensures safe and healthy cooking while protecting your coated cookware. Kitchen cooking utensils set don’t react with food or beverages, don’t retain odor or color, or produce any harmful gases, so you don’t have to worry about your families's health. And kitchen utensil set will last longer than other plastic and nylon cooking utensils. 🍴 【EASY TO USE AND STORAGE】 One-piece molding without any gaps to capture food, make this kitchen cooking utensils set easier to clean. Kitchen utensils set with holder makes it easier to organize your cooking utensils. And has an extra 12 hooks that allow you to hang all your cooking utensils set conveniently, help save your counter space and keep tidy. Note: Do not soak it for a long time in water. We recommend washing these cookware utensils set by hand. 🍴 【NO BENDING & NO RUSTING】 High quality stainless steel makes our kitchen cooking utensils set more durable, without the worry of bending, breaking, rusting during use. The stainless-steel handle of the kitchen utensil set is wrapped in silicone so you don't have to worry about burning your delicate hands. Exquisite workmanship makes our cooking utensils set more advanced, which can perfectly blend with your kitchen decoration. Our kitchen utensils are very durable and worth your choice. 🍴 【PERFECT FOR NONSTICK COOKWARE】 Silicone cooking utensils set can resistant to high temperatures, unlike plastic and nylon tableware, which melt easily. And our kitchen utensil set use all-silicone soft head, unlike metal cutlery that can hurt a nonstick pan. The silicone cooking utensils extend the life of your kitchen pans, and keep the cookware surface not scratched or dented.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pegz7DsnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iFedio","source_asin":"B08BY8S5J7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BY8S5J7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BY8S5J7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
