window.products.push({"id":500053,"name":"VOTIVO Red Currant Collection Soy Blend Highly Fragranced Home Décor Candle #126-Brushed Slate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SpoXcpb0L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a moment with Red Currant, our best-selling fragrance. This bold vessel features a black matte finish and a shapely, tapered design that instantly adds a touch of flair to any space. Every Votivo candle is meticulously crafted with a proprietary soy-blend wax formulation that ensures a clean, even burn and a memorable, one-of-a-kind fragrance experience. What Makes it Special: One-of-a-kind fragrance Soy Blend Wax Paper & Cotton Wicks Paraben Free Phthalate Free Formaldehyde Free Fragrance:Red Currant Fragrance Family:Fruity Fragrance Description:The one that canât be duplicated. Itâs the perfect balance of fresh, fruity, and a whole lot of flair. Use and Care: Snip Snip.Trim your wicks to 1/4 inch before lighting. This will allow for a clean lighting experience and extend the burn time of your candle. Light it up.Candles have memory. So, to get the most out of your Votivo, let it burn. A good rule of thumb is to leave it lit for at least four hours, especially the first time. Cool + Rest.Extinguish the flame and let your candle completely cool. Snip the wick again and get ready to enjoy your next Votivo moment. Warning.Burn within sight. Keep away from things that catch fire. Keep away from children. To prevent fire, place only on heat resistant surfaces. Avoid drafts. Avoid cold surfaces such as glass or marble. Keep foreign matter and wick trimmings out of candle. Specifications Volume:10.2 oz. Lifespan: 80 hours Product Size (inches):4.5l x 4.5w x 3.0h Package Weight (pounds):1.65 Sold as a set of:1 Item Number:96FF126S","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SpoXcpb0L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Votivo","source_asin":"B07SNGGMJZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SNGGMJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SNGGMJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
