window.products.push({"id":500176,"name":"NESCAFÉ Dolce Gusto Coffee Machine, Majesto, Espresso, Cappuccino and Latte Pod Machine, 1798.07ml","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":276.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SXAMXWFbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The intuitive NESCAFÉ Dolce Gusto Majesto automatic capsule coffee machine is designed to satisfy everyone's taste and bring the coffee shop experience to your office. Majesto is a compact machine for professional use. Its intelligent water tank has a built-in automatic water level detector so there's always enough to prepare the beverages you and your colleagues love. PROFESSIONAL QUALITY COFFEE - Create professional quality coffees with a thick velvety crema, thanks to the machine's high-pressure system (up to 17 bars). With our hermetically sealed capsules, which preserve coffee freshness, you’ll enjoy rich aromatic cups every time. A convenient eco-mode feature automatically switches off your NESCAFÉ Dolce Gusto Majesto coffee machine after 30 minutes of inactivity, meaning this machine has an A rating in energy consumption. 17 COFFEE CREATIONS to choose from with Nescafé Dolce Gusto. Enjoy a choice of Espresso Intenso, aromatic Medium Roast, and full-bodied Dark Roast, to frothy Cappuccino and smooth Latte Macchiato. Specially designed for professional use: the intuitive interface allows full personalization and customization, meaning everyone can enjoy their favorite coffee just the way they want. Majesto's connectivity function means your machine always has the latest beverages. Automatic service reminders tell you when your coffee machine needs maintenance and guide you through the descaling process. Optional accessory for plumbed water eliminates the need to refill the water tank and allows you to directly plumb your NESCAFÉ Dolce Gusto Majesto directly into your main water line. Ideal for locations serving less than 30 cups per day. Dimensions 14.2\"W x 13.4\"D x 14.2\"H. Weighs 11.9 pounds. Electrical: 110V, 60Hz, max. 1460W. Discover NESCAFE Dolce Gusto and rediscover coffee.Water Line: Optional accessory allows machine to be plumbed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SXAMXWFbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dolce Gusto","source_asin":"B08QG4J4MW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QG4J4MW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QG4J4MW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
