window.products.push({"id":500199,"name":"[8 Pack] Bento Lunch Boxes , 3 Compartments Food Storage Containers set with lids , BPA Free , Microwave , Dishwasher , and Freezer Safe + [FREE BONUS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oWiLDDUHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Arrange healthy meals for your family can be a challenge . Storage containers are awkwardly sized for small amounts of leftovers, taking up valuable space in the refrigerator or your lunch bag; The Bento lunchbox by Goodsupply is the perfect solution. Foods can be kept separate and fresh, whether you want to store fruits and vegetables, finger-foods, desserts, or an entrée and side dishes. You can keep a healthy snack on-hand so it’s convenient while you’re at home, or easily pack a meal for school, work, or road trips. They are BPA-free and can withstand repeated runs through the dishwasher, microwave, or freezer - to make meal preparation and cleanup incredibly easy. They stack nested together, for easy and efficient storage. Lids come in four different colors, so every member of the family will be able to instantly identify their own lunch as they head out for the day. Children will also be able to easily open the lid unaided. Note: Because these lids are designed to be easy-to-open, they are NOT leak-proof. Take care to keep the container upright when it holds liquids or very juicy items. If you’re on a diet, a Bento lunch box will make it easier to stick to; the compartments are roomy enough to hold a meal for an adult, while providing automatic portion control. Also, having a healthy meal packed will decrease the temptation and expense of going out for fast-food while at work. These compartmentalized containers are good for more than holding a meal or a snack; they can also be used as an attractive serving tray at a party. Or they can hold and organize small items which are not food at all: household items such as screws, nails, first-aid supplies; Legos and other small toys; items for arts and crafts projects; dice and game pieces, and much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oWiLDDUHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoodSupply","source_asin":"B01F03LVJU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F03LVJU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F03LVJU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
