window.products.push({"id":500205,"name":"Organic Chamomile, Calendula & Oatmeal Cold Process Soap With Shea Butter / Vegan + Chemical Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81roojI57lL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This super gentle vegan cold process soap is made with chamomile tea, ground oats, organic chamomile, and calendula flowers. These ingredients are all naturally soothing for sensitive, irritated and problematic skin conditions like eczema & psoriasis. These ingredients also provide very gentle exfoliation for cleansing. It also contains sweet almond oil, shea butter, hemp seed & apricot oils which are all great for soothing delicate skin as well as moisturizing and conditioning the skin. This soap does not contain any additional essential oils for scent, and has a mellow pleasing scent of chamomile and calendula, similar to that of chamomile tea. It can be used on the face, hands and body, and is even gentle enough for baby skin. Approx. 4 oz PLEASE NOTE: Our soaps do not contain hardening waxes or hardening additives found in commercial soaps, so they need to be placed on a well draining soap dish after each use to extend the life of the soap. Because we make our soap in small batches slight variations may occur from batch to batch. Our products NEVER contain: parabens, sulfates, animal fats, by-products, petroleum products (mineral oil or paraffin), phthalates, synthetic fragrance, or artificial color!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81roojI57lL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoddessVerde","source_asin":"B00CNTTYQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CNTTYQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CNTTYQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
