window.products.push({"id":500322,"name":"Guardian Bell Owl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nuexVe8aL._AC_.jpg","description":"These amazing high quality and detail, pewter bells come in a variety of styles, but they all have one thing in common: they bring extra good luck to whomever receives them. Bells have been used for centuries to repel mischievous spirits and bring good will, luck and blessings. These bells should be attached anywhere extra love and protection is wanted! Attach them to a keyring, pet, door or gate, or wherever you so choose! Good luck will abound! Good Luck Bells are made in the USA, using state of the art lead-free pewter. Each bell comes with a Legend of the Bell legend card, 24mm nickel plated split ring and a 2\"x 3 1/2 velveteen drawstring black bag. According to the legend these bells have even more power when given as a gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nuexVe8aL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUDHEN","source_asin":"B07MMS6PPF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MMS6PPF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MMS6PPF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":500323,"name":"Beehive Collection Honey & Syrup Dispensers w/ 6-oz Capacity & Spring Flap Lid, Chrome/Glass (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BUVK4ybNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"6 oz. With side spring flap chrome metal lid Glass body Syrup Dispenser,Access your favorite pancake syrups and honey without the mess with the Beehive Syrup Dispensers. Featuring a holding capacity of 6 ounces, these Honey Pots and Syrup Dispenser comes with a side spring flap chrome metal lid along with a glass body. The extended chrome handle allows you to easily pour as much sweetness on your pancakes, waffles, hot tea, and more without making a mess in the process. The perfect companion to your tea time tableware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BUVK4ybNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kiwivi Tableware","source_asin":"B0735S2XK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0735S2XK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0735S2XK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":500324,"name":"1 Gallon (10\"x16\") DIY 7 Mil Thick Long Term Food Storage Bags (with 100)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qsy7js+yL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"If you are searching do-it-yourself long term food storage options, then you already know the importance of keeping your food protected and fresh. Now the question is what product to buy. This do it your self home food storage kit contains not only the most durable long term food storage bag on the market but also 300cc oxygen absorbers and labels. Here are 4 reasons Emergency Zone Brand multilaminate food storage bags can't be beat. (1) 4 layer laminate: most bags include three layers, polyethylene, aluminum, and polyester. This is a durable laminate but lacks puncture resistance. We have added a nylon layer specifically to increase puncture resistance. (2) 7 mil thickness: before buying a bag, see how thick it is. The thicker the more durable and the better moisture and oxygen barrier. Most range from 3.5 to 5 mils in thickness, compared to our 7 mil. (3) Oversized: our bags are 10x16 inches, a few inches larger than the standard 1 gallon bag. This extra room either allows for more food to be stored or for more room to seal easily. (4) Labels: all bags need to be labeled. Although permanent marker will label mylar bags, we have added a label to each one allowing you to easily record the contents and date of packaging. Of course you also receive 300cc oxygen absorbers, sealed in a multilamiate resealable pouch. Simply add one oxygen absorber to each pouch along with food, seal and label. Seal bags at home with a standard clothes iron, hair straightener or induction sealer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qsy7js+yL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emergency Zone","source_asin":"B00EV5C972","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EV5C972","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EV5C972","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
