window.products.push({"id":500402,"name":"FYD Electric Garlic Chopper, Portable Onion Chopper - Spice Grinder Electric with Type C Charge Port - Veggie Chopper for Chili Ginger Onion Vegetable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61erG6s3XYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<b> FOOD- GRADE SAFE MATERIALS <b> : The FYD mini garlic chopper is made of high-quality food-grade materials, all materials are BPA-free, which are healthy for kitchen use and even for baby food. There are three 304 stainless steel sharp blades inside, which are rust-proof, durable. <b> TYPE -C USB CHARGING & HIGH PERFORMANCE <b> : The electric food chopper equipped with Type-C USB charging, wireless portable. The electric spice grinder have 50W motor, designed to drive 3 35-degree S-sharp stainless steel blades features the speed of 1000rpm suitable for spice blender, nut chopper and veggie chopper. <b> ELEGANT LOOK & SAFETY DESIGN <b> : The FYD onion chopper electric comes with unique wood grain appearance, which is simple but distinctive, perfectly matching your modern kitchen. Moreover, to ensure better and safer using experience, we adopts magnetic induction design, namely, the electric chopper will not work unless the lid is closed. <b> EASY TO USE AND CLEAN <b> : This electric grinder is very simple and easy to use. One touch button to switch the food grinders electric on or off , just fill the container with your ingredients, lock the cover, you can get an evenly shred food in a few seconds. Besides, the electric spice grinder is waterproof and the blade is detachable, allowing you to easily rinse and clean without any residues. <b> TIPS FOR USE <b> : It is recommended that you cut large pieces of food into small pieces before use. Don't pile up the bottom space. For vegetables/fruits with hard skin, peel it off first. For hard roots such as carrots, beetroots, celeries, etc. make sure to PREBOIL them or MICROWAVE them quickly first before chopping them using the veggie chopper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61erG6s3XYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FYD","source_asin":"B08SVZSN7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SVZSN7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SVZSN7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
