window.products.push({"id":500585,"name":"Clan Crest Young Engraved Glencairn Whisky Glass in Gift Carton","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nNNbKny4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This NEW, MINT 4-1/2\" tall tasting glass in the thistle shape design is QUALITY ETCHED with the CLAN NAME and CREST In the long and illustrious history of whisky, there has never been a single definitive glass that the whisky world could call its own. Now, following in the tradition of Scottish innovation, the Glencairn Glass has arrived. The Glencairn Glass’ roots lie in the traditional nosing and tasting glasses used by master blenders and connoisseurs around the world. The unique and stylish shape has been crafted with eminent care to enhance the enjoyment of single malts and aged blends. The tapered mouth allows and ease of drinking not associated with traditional nosing glasses. While capturing that all-important bouquet. The wide bowl allows the fullest appreciation of the whisky’s colour and the solid base is designed to be easy on the hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nNNbKny4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLENCAIRN","source_asin":"B00DX7BN3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DX7BN3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DX7BN3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
