window.products.push({"id":500653,"name":"M+A Matting 2246 Grey Ash PET Polyester WaterHog ECO Grand Premier Entrance Mat, Half Oval Pattern, 2.3' Length x 4' Width, For Indoor/Outdoor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bt-t-nO7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exceptional performance and extraordinary beauty. An amazing mat series combining all of the performance of our WaterHog Premier mat, a green friendly face constructed of 100 percent post consumer recycled PET polyester fiber system that is reclaimed from plastic bottles providing a mat surface with an attractive look that's easy to maintain. The face design can be configured a half oval pattern. Additionally, WaterHog Eco Grand Premier mats have a 100 percent rubber backing that contains 15 to 20 percent post consumer recycled car tire rubber. Certified slip-resistant by the National Floor Safety Institute. Face NUBS are reinforced with rubber to resist crushing, maintaining high performance and extending product life. \"Water Dam\" border: Border is designed to hold water and dirt on mat to minimize slip hazards and floor damage around perimeter of the mat. Raised NUB surface removes and traps dirt and moisture and holds it on mat below shoe level so it is not tracked in. Rubber backing lays flat, won't crack or curl like vinyl mats. Durable PET polyester face suitable for indoor/outdoor use. 100 percent recycled PET polyester fiber system dries quickly preventing fading and rotting. Easy to clean: Just vacuum or hose off and hang to dry. Colorfast: Solution dyed for excellent light and wet fastness. Not adversely effected by salt or ice melt. Should not be used in areas exposed to animal fats (kitchens) or petroleum products. Passes flammability standard DOC-FF-1-70. 3/8\" Nub height. Sunburst/Diamond design. Thickness: 0.160\" - border; 0.190\" - nubs; 0.050\" - between nubs. Grey Ash color. Measures 2.3' length by 4' width.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bt-t-nO7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M+A Matting","source_asin":"B008BWCBNI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008BWCBNI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008BWCBNI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":500654,"name":"Freonic 10,000 BTU Portable Air Conditioner | AC for Rooms up to 350 Sq.Ft. | LED Display | 24H Timer | Auto-Restart | Sleep Mode | Dehumidifier | Whi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":449.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PrtGpUt4S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PORTABLES DON’T HAVE TO BE UGLY: The sleek design of this Freonic 7000 BTU Portable Air Conditioner (10,000 BTU previous ASHRAE) packs a powerful cooling punch for small to medium rooms up to 350 sq. ft. in a slim 14.2” x 16.5” x 28.4” frame. THREE FUNCTIONS, ONE APPLIANCE: With 3 operating modes – cool, fan, and dry – this air conditioner can handle any indoor needs that you have when it’s hot and humid outdoors. Three fan speeds, auto-cool technology, oscillating louvers for even air circulation, and dehumidification up to 60 pints per day keep you cool and comfortable effortlessly. EASY ON THE EYES: Bright white LEDs display the temperature through the front plastic for ease of visibility from anywhere in the room. Use either the on-board controls or the included remote control to adjust temperature, fan speeds, and set the sleep timer. CLEAN AND SIMPLE: The included washable filter catches and holds pet hair, dust, and other airborne particles to keep them from clogging the internal components. A clean filter alert will let you know when it’s time to vacuum or wash. A standard three-prong plug fits almost any outlet, and a 6’ power cord gives you placement flexibility. ALL INSTALLATION MATERIALS INCLUDED: The included installation kit contains all required hardware, including the exhaust hose, window bracket, and connectors. Bracket will fit vertical or horizontal windows from 20-46” wide with a minimum opening of 5.9”.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PrtGpUt4S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FREONIC","source_asin":"B095X71XDP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095X71XDP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095X71XDP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
