window.products.push({"id":500656,"name":"Nifeliz Space Astronaut Showing Photo Frame Building Set, Creative 3D Space Astronaut Photo Decoration, A Fun Project and Great Astronaut Photo Frame ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718F4u81eJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Build Creativity: Build a 3D brick version of a famous photo of man’s first moon landing mission in a brick photo frame with this creative Nifeliz Space Astronaut Showing Photo Frame set. Enjoy a fun project discovering innovative building techniques to capture every stunning detail and display your completed masterpiece to add new space-themed decor in your room. Made For Display: This impressive set features a beautiful brick-built frame and turns the astronaut in the original photo into innovative three dimensions with realistic details in the helmet, spacesuit and hands that can move. Once finished, display the wonderful piece on the wall or prop it up on a shelf with the included bracket. Create and Decorate: This wonderfully detailed astronaut photo frame set offers an immersive, rewarding building experience to unwind as you bring the iconic scene on the moon to life in a creative way. The set measures 13.18in(L)*15.74in(W)*3.34in(H), making a gorgeous decor or conversation piece on the wall or shelf. Perfect Gift: This 2,188-piece astronaut photo frame set comes in luxurious box packaging with a detailed instruction and makes a fantastic gift for astronaut fans and space theme lovers to expand their space collection. You can also combine this set with other Nifeliz Space Astronaut building kits for even more creative fun and decor. A 3-month-100%-Money-Back Guarantee: We offer refund if you are not happy with your purchase. Three tests are carried out to ensure every piece of our product is entirely picked up by machine. If your sets still have missing pieces, please contact us and we will send them to you for free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718F4u81eJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nifeliz","source_asin":"B0B122KMFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B122KMFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B122KMFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
