window.products.push({"id":500669,"name":"Halloween Cupcake Stand Decoration 3 Tier Halloween Cardboard Cupcake Holder Halloween Party Bat Pumpkin Cupcake Tower for Halloween Birthday Wedding ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T+CseNbsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎃 SAFE MATERIAL：Our Halloween cake stand is made of high quality cardboard, durable, non-toxic, odorless and reusable. The use of cross construction makes the stand sturdy and not easy to break, enough to meet all kinds of Halloween needs and create a perfect party. 🎃 SUITABLE SIZE：The cupcake dessert stand has 3 layers, with dimensions of 11 inches, 9 inches, 7 inches, about 4 inches between the layers, and about 14 inches high, which can hold 15 to 24 cupcakes or other snacks. The 3-layer stable structure makes the cake tower not bend or wobble, but is stronger and more durable. 🎃 EASY ASSEMBLY PARTY DECORATION：The 3-Tier Orange Cardboard Cake Tower lets you quickly assemble and disassemble in under a minute without any tools. You assemble your stand first, then take the largest circle and slide it down to the bottom notch, repeat with medium circles and end with the smallest circle, and finally insert the insert with the words Happy Halloween into the top of the cake tower. 🎃 WIDE RANGE OF USE：The Halloween Snack Stand can be used in all Halloween related parties, birthday parties and baby showers, etc. It can be used as a beautiful accessory for cupcakes, fruit, cheese, snacks, cookies, candy, donuts, dips, etc. , Displaying your party food on these fun snack stands will look great and make your party more fun and halloween, and guests will remember this snack stand. 🎃 AMAZING HALLOWEEN DECOR：Do you want to make your Halloween party unique and impressive? Now you need an eye-catching dessert table decoration.Different from the conventional cake stand, this cupcake cake stand can bring a newer visual effect. The large size can hold more cakes and snacks, suitable for families and large parties.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T+CseNbsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aendraty","source_asin":"B0BBVWQG71","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBVWQG71","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBVWQG71","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
