window.products.push({"id":500798,"name":"Stainless Steel Tea Infuser Tea Strainer Obsterm Steeper Tea Diffuser With Hanging Hook Handle Stick Pipe Holes Steeper For Loose Leaf Tea, Rose, Coff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dwFVtY9oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【HIGH QUALITY FDA】: Made of premium food-grade stainless steel, BPA free, strong corrosion-resistance, sturdy and durable, higher hardness and sturdiness. 【ENJOY YOUR TEA】: The tea strainer is suitable for office, home, business trips, and travel tea sets. Our tea infuser is also for mulling spices and infusing herbs. 【LONG HANGABLE DESIGN】: Curved handle design, you can be hung on the edge of the cup. Smooth edges do not hurt your hands. 【EASY TO CLEAN】: The Tea Strainer is really easy to clean, Hand wash is recommended. Dishwasher safe. Leave them to dry after cleaning for better maintenance, reusable for years and years. 【FINE FILTER】: Our Tea Strainers let water pass through but keep loose leaves in inside. Say goodbye to debris in your tea.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dwFVtY9oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YCF PERFECT UNION","source_asin":"B09NBW1XWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NBW1XWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NBW1XWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
