window.products.push({"id":500832,"name":"OBBOLLY Swivel Rocker Recliner Chair - Manual Glider Rocking Recliner Chair, Wingback Design 360° Swivel Chair with Lumbar Pillow, Cup Holders, Side P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":569.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9119geEvjlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Swivel Rocker Recliner Chair】With a swivel rocking base, the manual recliner chair can swivel 360 degrees and rock forth and back, especially suitable for mothers to hold the baby to tell stories and coax her to sleep, limited 30° rocking mode makes you experience Zero Gravity. Extremely easy to use with side handle design, controllable 95-160° reclining angle, help you find the most comfortable relaxing posture, extending footrest allows you to fully stretch. 【High Quality Materials】The glider rocking chair adopt sturdy faux leather to make the surface of the sofa which make the sofa looks very smooth and exquisite. High density soft sponge can perfectly wrap your body and give you the extreme comfort.Solid metal frame and sturdy wooden construction which can well support the weight and durable in use. Hold up to MAX 350 lbs. 【Soothing Gliding Chair with Lumbar Pillow】There is something so soothing about a soft back-and-forth motion. The rocking motion combined with the really comfy upholstery and design of these recliners can easily help any insomniac fall asleep. Extra lumbar pillow can provide better lumbar support, avoid deforming your lumbar spine, thereby protecting your lumbar spine. 【Widely Used】This swivel rocker recliner chair can be used in many occasions, such as you can sit on it in living room to enjoy watching TV or you can put it in your study room to enjoy reading books. All in all, it’s a suitable sofa for small space if you need a sofa which will not occupy too much space. There are two cup holders and side pockets on the armrests of the glider rocker recliner for small items within reach. 【Easy Assembly & Warranty】This swivel rocker recliner chair can be assembled in 5 minutes with the instruction included. We ship them on the same day but the carrier may deliver them to your door on different days. We provide 24-hour customer service and free exchange for installation problems, damaged and missing parts with 1-year warranty guarantee, feel free to contact us for any purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9119geEvjlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OBBOLLY","source_asin":"B09CDQ9MGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CDQ9MGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CDQ9MGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
