window.products.push({"id":500878,"name":"193 Pcs Graduation Party Supplies Congrats Grad Decorations Class of 2023, Disposable Plates and Napkins with Tablecloth Cups Dinnerware Sets for Grad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gBaz16e7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SERVES 24 GUESTS】:The graduation decorations class of 2023 dinnerware set includes 24 of each of the following: 9\" dinner plates, 7\" dessert plates, plastic knives, spoons, forks, napkins, cups, straws; and 54\" * 109\" tablecloth x1. 193 total pieces allow you to serve 24 guests at one time. 【GREAT AND UNIQUE DESIGN】:This party supplies are designed with classic graduation elements, such as grad cap, diploma, book, and so on. Ideal for the graduation party decorations and event table supplies. At the same time, we also designed a variety of different colors to meet your different needs, it's easy to create a vibrant graduation party. 【DISPOSABLE PRACTICAL PARTY DECOR】:Graduation party should be a time to celebrate and enjoy with friends and family. The disposable paper tableware sets can help you get rid of the trouble of washing dishes, save time and effort. Add this to set your 2023 graduation decorations for a quick and easy cleanup when the celebration is over. 【QUALITY MATERIAL】:Our disposable plates, cups and napkins are made of quality paper, reliable and safe to use, colorful and brightly. And They won't folded, teared or broken easily, ideal for desserts, party food and beverages. The tablecloth is made of plastic, which is easy to clean. (NOTE: Do not microwave plates and cups please.) 【IDEAL FOR GRADUATION PARTY】:This set of graduation decorations is widely used to graduation themed parties, dining tables, dessert tables, etc. A little simple decoration can make your graduation party attract the attention of all guests, which can help you quickly create an holiday atmosphere. It is very suitable for family members and friends to enjoy the good time of the graduation party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gBaz16e7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wironlst","source_asin":"B0C3CWHV71","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3CWHV71","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3CWHV71","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
