window.products.push({"id":500889,"name":"Y&ME YM Bathroom Floating Shelf with Drawer, Set of 2 Floting Nightstands for Bedroom, Rustic Wooden Wall Mounted Bathroom Shelves, Floating Nightstan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gteFA62NL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","description":"[Simple and Suitable]: Our bathroom shelves simply designed with solid Paulownia wood, the floating shelf with drawer not only can help you free-up home space for store keys, DVDs, phone notepads, pens, and other knick-knacks, but also perfect for utilizing your walls efficiently, free up more floor space. [Floating Shelf with Drawer]: This floating shelf features a hidden drawer adds a rustic, elegant touch to any room while adding functional storage space. Our individual hanging drawers offer a beautiful and functional place to display and store all household items. [Multipurpose Floating Shelves]: Mount your shelf in the bedroom, kitchen, bathroom, living room, study, nursery or entryway . Storage and display for stylishly flaunt books, plants, spices, electronics or even cosmetics. [Easy to Install]: Measures with 12 L x 5 W x 2.6 H inch.No assembly is required. The bathroom shelves comes with an easy to follow hanging template and all hanging hardware is included for secure wall display. [Quality Guarantee]: Lightweight but sturdy, smart, and functional solid wooden wall floating shelf. You can gain a refund should you not be satisfied with the quality. Order with confidence, click and add to cart now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gteFA62NL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Y&ME YM","source_asin":"B07ZJ5WL7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZJ5WL7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZJ5WL7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":500890,"name":"SAVON Round Wooden Pen Stand Stationary Holder Rustic Spinner Organizer (Fleur De Lis)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zagp7ydpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hand finished caddy organizer made of solid wood. SAVON’s exquisitely designed line of furniture, accessories and home decor items create earthy living spaces with handcrafted products made from natural, eco-friendly fibres and materials. Each product tells the story of the craftsman who painstakingly weaves, shapes, carves and creates a solution for your home. A solution that reminds you of the outdoors. It takes you by the hand and walks you to the place you had long forgotten. The smells and sights of the forest, the flowers in the spring and the rippling sounds of the water by a starlit bonfire. In a world full of fears for the future of our planet, we need to be reminded of the raw beauty of nature. Let’s bring the outdoors Indoors!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zagp7ydpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAVON","source_asin":"B088WG8R62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088WG8R62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088WG8R62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":500891,"name":"Yankee Candle Balsam & Clove Scented, Classic 22oz Large Jar Single Wick Candle, Over 110 Hours of Burn Time","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V74Zt5gxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Yankee candle large jar candle is the perfect size for enjoying all your go-to fragrances. At 22 oz., the candle provides a long burn to add a pleasant aroma to dinner parties, lazy Saturdays, and a season's worth of little moments. Each candle from Yankee candle is made in America with premium-grade paraffin with quality ingredients from around the world, and each wick is straightened by hand to ensure the best quality burn. Fragrance Notes: Top: Clove, Fresh Balsam, Cinnamon, Mid: Cassia (spice from bark of east Asian evergreen), Pine, Base: Cedarwood, Amber, Top note is the initial impression of the fragrance, middle note is the main body of the scent, and base is its final impression.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V74Zt5gxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yankee Candle","source_asin":"B09XW2JM8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XW2JM8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XW2JM8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
