window.products.push({"id":500990,"name":"RayLineDo® Eco-Friendly Resuable Large Multi Colour Bohemia Canvas DIY Crafts Carry-All Tote Bag Lunch & Grocery Shopping Bags Beach Bag Handbag 19x16","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610wwucRUxL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Made of durable high quality light weight canvas, with self-fabric handles, easy to carry, fold and store. Large size of 19 x 16 inch, approx 50 x 41 cm. Please allow 1-2 cm hand measure error. Perfect for shopping or carrying staff. Eco-friendly and resuable, much economic, useful and fashion compare with supermarket shopping bag. Totally 30 different styles available in store, new color or patterns will keep coming. Please wash by hand with cold water. Due to display difference, the bag may be not as bright as the pictures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610wwucRUxL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RayLineDo","source_asin":"B01BBP1P42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BBP1P42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BBP1P42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":500991,"name":"Goebel - Gustav Klimt - Glass Tea Light Holder - The Kiss (1907-1908)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gh5Pja-DL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This elegant Gustav Klimt Glass tea light features the Vienna Secessionist’s best-known work The Kiss (1907-1908). The Kiss depicts a couple locked in an embrace, located in an indeterminate and ambiguous place and time. The viewer is only able to see of the embracing couple, segments of their bodies and virtually nothing of the man’s face so as to emphasize the engulfing nature of this intimate and passionate moment. Aside from the figures, the rest of the canvas dissolves into shimmering, extravagant yet flat patterning. Klimt’s ties with the art nouveau movement are reflected in the patterning of the figures, which in itself reflects the visual conflict between two and three-dimensionality associated with other modernist artists like Edgar Degas. In The Kiss, the patterning also signifies gender contrasts – rectangles for the man’s garment, circles for the woman’ s. Yet the patterning also unites the two lovers into a single formal entity underscoring their erotic union. Scholars believe the kiss represents Klimt and his long-time friend Emilie Flöge, a member of the Viennese bohemian and fin-de-siècle circles. In the words of the poet Friedrich Schiller’s famous Ode to Joy: “Joy, thou gleaming spark divine… This kiss to the whole world!”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gh5Pja-DL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gustav Klimt","source_asin":"B00NMZV18A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-500991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NMZV18A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NMZV18A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
